# Python for quick analytics

For throwaway scans, decodes, histogram/tail compares, and LiteDB/packet-log analytics, write a short **Python** script under `Tools/_tmp/...`.

Do **not** spin up a new `dotnet` project (`*.csproj`, `Program.cs`, obj/bin) just to read captures or dump fields.

Use C# only when the check must call existing game/parser types that Python cannot reach cheaply.

```python
# Tools/_tmp/scan_whatever.py
# one file, stdlib + litedb/pymongo/etc if already available
```
